    <content:encoded>The weather is nearly perfect and tomorrow I am going flying. Mom and Alex are being very good sports about the new obsession. When they land from their commercial flight they are making me (and a few guests) a nice dinner then trundling off to get enough sleep to head out to Catalina for breakfast and Santa Maria for lunch. Friends have a house up in &lt;em&gt;Sideways&lt;/em&gt; country and they will meet us at the airport and head to a vineyard with us for a picnic. I feel like a jet setter. Then next weekend I am taking them to the Grand Canyon for Saturday and Sunday. Yippeee.</content:encoded>
